      "accessCategory": "public",
      "granularity": "model",
      "rationale": "Mandatory per JRC Table 8. ESPR Annex III(c) reads 'GTIN or equivalent', and the JRC notes no GS1 scheme is used across the steel chain (p. 50): the 'or equivalent' reading is open (dictionary batch open point 5)."
